<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<p>Do you want to live a unique experience abroad while gaining work experience? IAESTE gives you the opportunity to broaden your horizons, discover new cultures and establish international connections. Our program allows you to do paid internships abroad that will help you develop your skills in your field of study. Do not miss the opportunity to be part of a global student community and kick-start your professional career.</p>

