<p>Annually, around 60 students from different Spanish universities take the opportunity to do their internships with IAESTE abroad.<br>IAESTE has been offering the possibility of doing internships abroad for over 75 years, thus complementing university studies and promoting the learning of new languages and cultural exchange.<br>Take the plunge and be part of a great international family made up of students dedicated to facilitating international exchange. Contact your Local Committee and participate in the activities carried out at your university.</p>

